WEBVTT

00:01:27.909 --> 00:01:30.394
until you realize that you
very much are that woman,

00:01:30.418 --> 00:01:32.915
and cannot imagine being anyone else.

00:01:33.344 --> 00:01:35.364
As I got older, I began to accept

00:01:35.388 --> 00:01:38.721
that I am, indeed, a feminist,
and a proud one.

00:01:38.745 --> 00:01:41.539
I hold certain truths to be self-evident:

00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:44.015
Women are equal to men.

00:01:44.039 --> 00:01:46.820
We deserve equal pay for equal work.

00:01:46.844 --> 00:01:49.828
We have the right to move
through the world as we choose,

00:01:49.852 --> 00:01:51.819
free from harassment or violence.

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:55.787
We have the right to easy,
affordable access to birth control,

00:01:55.811 --> 00:01:57.708
and reproductive services.

00:01:57.732 --> 00:02:00.303
We have the right to make choices
about our bodies,